      <activity id="2a00f1c2-ac4b-57a3-8020-3212ee5d57d7" activityNameId="4ca3b4a4-6b4e-5d2d-8163-ef908eee6d8b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 15MW, offshore, tower</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 15MW, offshore, tower
UUID=1fea7dab-86f9-359d-8153-3b3bd0f87d7b
Wind turbine tower, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the IEA reference 15MW offshore wind turbine.
The distance to installation port is assumed to be 80 km.
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.

Main data source for material composition:
Renewable Energy Material Property Database, REMPD (Cooperman et al., 2023)
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1fea7dab-86f9-359d-8153-3b3bd0f87d7b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
